mbus 13\",\"value\":4.2}]}'></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"hr\"></div>\n\n<h2>Pros &amp; Cons</h2>\n<div class=\"grid cols-3\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px;\">\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">Aero 14</div>\n    <p class=\"card-desc\">Light, bright, long-lasting</p>\n    <span class=\"badge\">$1,299</span> <span class=\"badge-secondary badge\">4.6 ★ (1,840)</span>\n    <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n    <p class=\"small up\" style=\"font-weight:600;\">Pros</p>\n    <ul class=\"small\"><li>Gorgeous OLED panel</li><li>Great battery</li><li>Quiet under load</li></ul>\n    <p class=\"small down\" style=\"font-weight:600;\">Cons</p>\n    <ul class=\"small\"><li>Soldered RAM</li><li>Glossy screen</li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">Forge 16</div>\n    <p class=\"card-desc\">Desktop power on the go</p>\n    <span class=\"badge\">$1,899</span> <span class=\"badge-secondary badge\">4.4 ★ (960)</span>\n    <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n    <p class=\"small up\" style=\"font-weight:600;\">Pros</p>\n    <ul class=\"small\"><li>Fastest of the three</li><li>Upgradeable RAM and SSD</li><li>Full port selection</li></ul>\n    <p class=\"small down\" style=\"font-weight:600;\">Cons</p>\n    <ul class=\"small\"><li>Heavy</li><li>Fans are audible</li></ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">Nimbus 13</div>\n    <p class=\"card-desc\">Everything you need, for less</p>\n    <span class=\"badge\">$999</span> <span class=\"badge-secondary badge\">4.2 ★ (2,310)</span>\n    <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n    <p class=\"small up\" style=\"font-weight:600;\">Pros</p>\n    <ul class=\"small\"><li>Lightest</li><li>Best battery life</li><li>Lowest price</li></ul>\n    <p class=\"small down\" style=\"font-weight:600;\">Cons</p>\n    <ul class=\"small\"><li>Dimmer screen</li><li>Small SSD</li></ul>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"hr\"></div>\n\n<h2>Pick Your Priority</h2>\n<p class=\"muted\">Select what matters most to you